	(text "01 Output stage: 4 octal sockets (solder side, as built; standard octal numbering), per-tube 220n coupling cap and 91k grid leak to its own bias (BIASn, sheet 03), 5.6k grid stopper, 1k 5 W flameproof screen resistor from V_SCREEN, 1 ohm cathode shunt with a power diode and a Kelvin tap (KELVn) to the sense amp (sheet 04)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 10.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0bee088a-6223-52c5-8e11-05d3e5b9bc01")
	)
	(text "Coupling cap 220 nF / 630 V film and grid leak 91k for all four types (decided 2026-11-23, V1 / V2): grid circuit 91k + 5.6k + 1k = 98 kOhm. 6550 DEVIATION: twice its 50 kOhm fixed-bias rating (Tung-Sol), accepted; covered by the cold-default bias, the firmware current loop and the hardware over-current trip. Within rating for 6L6GC / KT88 (100k) and EL34 (500k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3b6e6087-c370-518a-99a7-3d3d51087bd9")
	)
	(text "Ground: GND = AGND, the local star at the GND_PWR tab (J101 pin 2). The cathode shunts, the drive grounds (W24, solid at this end), the HV decoupling and the bias circuit return here. Heaters float: no heater reference on this board (interfaces.md 5). OT secondary COM is not connected here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "df2de6c0-5c48-57c0-87d0-7921b7d50793")
	)
