	(text "Pin 1 (g3 on EL34, NC on 6L6GC / KT88 / 6550) tied to pin 8 as built (PA-3). Pin 6 left free (internal on some types). UL taps of the 1650TA unused (VOX-10 / D7 reserved, not on this board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 181.61 0)
		(effects
